# Copy to `.env` and fill in to run the bench with a REAL LLM judge.
# (`.env` is gitignored.) The bundled demo uses a fake mock judge; a real
# pass/fail measurement needs a real model. See examples/run-your-agent.mjs.
#
# The example judge talks to any OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions endpoint
# (OpenAI, OpenRouter, Together, Groq, a local server, etc.). Pick one set:

# --- OpenAI ---
# JUDGE_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# JUDGE_API_KEY=sk-...

# --- OpenRouter (lets you point at Anthropic/Google/etc. behind one API) ---
# JUDGE_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# JUDGE_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet
# JUDGE_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# --- Local OpenAI-compatible server (Ollama, LM Studio, vLLM, ...) ---
# JUDGE_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# JUDGE_MODEL=llama3.1
# JUDGE_API_KEY=ignored
